 ('list-cell-skeleton','小さな図版と本文を左右に揃えた、一覧の行用の待機表示。','${--sg-bg:#24374a;--sg-a:#b0c4d8;--sg-line:#7b91a8}$ .sg-skeleton-frame{display:grid;grid-template-columns:47px minmax(0,1fr);gap:15px;min-height:149px;padding:17px;background:#2b4057;border:1px solid #788fa9;border-radius:5px}$ .sg-sk-hero{grid-column:1;grid-row:1/3;height:53px;margin:0;border-radius:4px}$ .sg-sk-hero i,$ .sg-sk-profile,$ .sg-sk-tiles{display:none}$ .sg-sk-lines{grid-column:2;gap:12px;align-self:center}$ .sg-sk-lines>i{height:6px;border-radius:2px}','B'),
